From 27db2efde9857695af09e5fcaba78ae00d4f6028 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Alex Chong <achong@meta.com>
Date: Tue, 17 Feb 2026 14:30:38 -1000
Subject: [PATCH 35/63] add non-zero length custom.css to avoid bug in
 libwebsockets

Summary:
Provide a nonempty custom.css file so the WebRTC HTTP server does not
close the connection while serving an empty stylesheet.
---
 host/frontend/webrtc/html_client/custom.css | 1 +
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+)

diff --git a/host/frontend/webrtc/html_client/custom.css b/host/frontend/webrtc/html_client/custom.css
index e69de29bb..f6cb94fcf 100644
--- a/host/frontend/webrtc/html_client/custom.css
+++ b/host/frontend/webrtc/html_client/custom.css
@@ -0,0 +1 @@
+/* Add non-zero length css file to prevent causing issues with libwebsockets on macOS */
